    "detailed_description": "In the distant future, a hyper-advanced CPU has been developed by the government. The CyberQuark Corporation has stolen this powerful technology to create a fleet of destructive AI robots. As a secret agent, your mission is to retrieve the stolen CPU and prevent CyberQuark from unleashing their deadly creations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Parkour Chief: Chapter Secret Agent, you'll need to combine parkour and stealth skills to infiltrate CyberQuark's headquarters. Navigate and fight your way through a series of obstacles and challenges to recover the CPU. Do you have what it takes to stop them?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game, developed entirely by Mustafa Soltanian Fard Jahromi, complements his Parkour Chief YouTube series.",
